      "purpose": "A charity auction site for fundraising events: a live-event hero with countdown and stats, a filterable catalog of donated items with current bids, bidding with preset increments and confirmation, a watchlist, cause progress bars and a post-event results page. It helps nonprofits run credible online auctions.",
